WEBVTT

00:01.880 --> 00:03.600
Man, this thing sure is heavy.

00:04.060 --> 00:06.719
When I see that sheltered noble girl,

00:06.720 --> 00:09.360
I just can't help wanting to tease her a bit.

00:09.810 --> 00:12.709
I've been surrounded by
gun smoke since I was born,

00:12.710 --> 00:15.289
surviving on muddy water,

00:15.290 --> 00:17.620
risking my life on the battlefield...

00:18.240 --> 00:20.810
But they're different.

00:21.480 --> 00:23.750
They say the Empire persecutes witches?

00:24.170 --> 00:25.070
No.

00:25.490 --> 00:28.300
It's the witches who look down on humans!

00:29.650 --> 00:32.260
That's why it pisses me off!

00:45.270 --> 00:47.120
Oh, thank goodness.

00:47.960 --> 00:50.360
I was planning to capture you alive anyway.

00:50.710 --> 00:54.089
Glad you're still breathing, little lady.

00:54.090 --> 00:56.299
T-That hurts...

00:56.300 --> 01:00.420
Am I really... bleeding this much?

01:02.610 --> 01:06.419
Huh, no wonder I couldn't
spot Your Astral Crest.

01:06.420 --> 01:09.540
So it was inside your eyes, huh, little lady?

01:11.220 --> 01:13.009
Uncle On,

01:13.010 --> 01:15.170
I understand now.

01:16.110 --> 01:19.050
War is absolutely no good at all.

01:19.490 --> 01:22.089
Because it hurts this much.

01:22.090 --> 01:25.030
Oh? You've changed your mind now?

01:25.960 --> 01:26.780
Yes.

01:27.210 --> 01:29.090
Let's end this war.

01:29.540 --> 01:32.609
With the complete annihilation
of the Imperial Army,

01:32.610 --> 01:35.159
I will no longer have any mercy.

01:35.160 --> 01:37.159
Mercy, you said?

01:37.160 --> 01:40.250
Don't get so cocky...

01:41.040 --> 01:43.079
...just because you survived once.

01:43.080 --> 01:46.589
The next shot you hear will be your last.

01:46.590 --> 01:50.170
Yes. It will be the last for all of you.

01:58.100 --> 01:59.629
EPISODE 8: DECISIVE BATTLE
What?!

01:59.630 --> 02:03.600
EPISODE 8: THE UNFORGIVEN

02:04.100 --> 02:06.459
Ah, too bad.

02:06.460 --> 02:11.500
If I'd pulled a little faster,
I could've strangled you cleanly.

02:11.870 --> 02:12.800
Well,

02:13.580 --> 02:15.530
you can say I'm still a bit inexperienced.

02:15.950 --> 02:19.330
How incorrigible these Imperial people are.

02:19.730 --> 02:22.709
You've scorned us as witches
and demons all this time,

02:22.710 --> 02:25.639
yet you were using the Star Spirits
behind the scenes.

02:25.640 --> 02:29.300
Oops, you've got the wrong
target for your anger.

02:30.380 --> 02:32.539
This Star Spirit experiment
couldn't have happened

02:32.540 --> 02:36.770
without the cooperation
of you royal family.

02:37.180 --> 02:40.729
I had already foreseen there were
traitors in the royal house,

02:40.730 --> 02:43.250
but I welcome any evidence
you're willing to provide.

02:43.600 --> 02:45.769
Ah, you're so dense.

02:45.770 --> 02:48.229
"If you beat me, I'll tell you."

02:48.230 --> 02:52.529
I suppose you should understand that
I won't say such a cliché line.

02:52.530 --> 02:56.610
Oh, my apologies.
How careless of me.

02:57.050 --> 02:59.909
The Fourth Generation
of the Stars, "Tsumugi"...

02:59.910 --> 03:02.159
It doesn't exist within the Sovereignty.

03:02.160 --> 03:05.210
It's a species born from
the Vortex inside the Empire.

03:06.800 --> 03:10.039
You want all the secrets I hold, don't you?

03:10.040 --> 03:11.799
That's why...

03:11.800 --> 03:14.469
...you can never leave this place.

03:14.470 --> 03:17.429
An invitation from a beautiful lady...

03:17.430 --> 03:20.049
It'd be disgraceful for a gentleman to refuse.

03:20.050 --> 03:23.539
I don't dislike that theatrical attitude.

03:23.540 --> 03:27.939
But I think I'd like your true face better.

03:27.940 --> 03:31.899
The ugly, cruel nature peeking out
from behind the mask...

03:31.900 --> 03:34.199
That's so very demon-like.

03:34.200 --> 03:36.319
I don't recall anything like that.

03:36.320 --> 03:39.760
Then I guess I'll let you
expose that face by force!

03:41.710 --> 03:43.950
By all means.
That's exactly what I want.

03:49.100 --> 03:50.659
What?

03:50.660 --> 03:53.719
Your physical attacks won't affect it.

03:53.720 --> 03:56.549
But I can interfere with you.

03:56.550 --> 03:59.469
Sounds like you're barking
about being invincible.

03:59.470 --> 04:02.239
That's exactly what I'm saying.

04:02.240 --> 04:04.560
This is the Star Spirit of Sin.

04:11.340 --> 04:15.360
If I destroy you, my "sins"
will disappear too, right?

04:15.830 --> 04:20.470
Your sins will multiply infinitely.

04:21.660 --> 04:23.579
Fine, I'll give it to you.

04:23.580 --> 04:25.320
You threw it away, huh?

04:26.030 --> 04:27.830
It was a prosthetic arm from the start.

04:29.790 --> 04:30.919
What?!

04:30.920 --> 04:35.449
A repeat offense carries far
heavier sins than the first.

04:35.450 --> 04:37.760
Now, be consumed by sin.

04:45.720 --> 04:48.480
A counter-star spirit grenade?

04:48.830 --> 04:51.289
It is immune to physical attacks.

04:51.290 --> 04:54.650
But interference aimed directly at
the Star Spirit itself does work, right?

04:55.360 --> 04:57.570
I've seen your Star Spirit.

04:58.040 --> 04:59.770
Next time, I'll finish you off.

05:01.020 --> 05:03.130
You think I'll let you escape?

05:13.680 --> 05:17.710
Damn you, impudent Imperial soldier...!

05:22.480 --> 05:24.709
You can't run.

05:24.710 --> 05:26.979
The Star Spirit of Sin...

05:26.980 --> 05:33.330
...will chase you even to the ends
of this Sovereignty!

05:39.360 --> 05:41.449
Don't step into this snow!

05:41.450 --> 05:44.319
Jhin, what's wrong?

05:44.320 --> 05:46.209
You're fine with it?

05:46.210 --> 05:48.700
Yes. So, what's—

05:49.300 --> 05:51.930
This snow just bit me.

05:52.830 --> 05:56.999
It's like walking over a mountain of needles!

05:57.000 --> 05:59.830
More importantly,
why is it only biting me?

06:01.780 --> 06:03.370
Umm...

06:04.410 --> 06:06.969
Some things created by Star Spirit arts

06:06.970 --> 06:10.389
react based on whether
Star Spirit energy is present or not.

06:10.390 --> 06:13.850
For example, palace doors or elevators—

06:14.270 --> 06:16.069
Ah, that was a slip.

06:16.070 --> 06:17.749
Just go on.

06:17.750 --> 06:22.189
This snow only bites those
without a Star Spirit.

06:22.190 --> 06:24.059
Boss, it's your turn.

06:24.060 --> 06:25.820
Me?!

06:26.130 --> 06:30.309
You guys are way too rough
on your captain!

06:30.310 --> 06:31.869
That's it, Boss.

06:31.870 --> 06:33.889
Just keep kicking that snow aside.

06:33.890 --> 06:35.960
Now, as for this one...

06:44.830 --> 06:45.889
Jhin...

06:45.890 --> 06:47.299
Jhin, over here!

06:47.300 --> 06:50.010
There's no one in this room
at the very back!

06:50.330 --> 06:53.219
Nene, just follow Boss's footprints.

06:53.220 --> 06:54.639
Don't touch the snow.

06:54.640 --> 06:55.620
Yes!

07:01.160 --> 07:03.649
What a persistent old lady...

07:03.650 --> 07:07.199
This is already a world of snow.

07:07.200 --> 07:14.040
Look, I can see your footprints so clearly.

07:14.720 --> 07:16.080
Don't speak.

07:18.000 --> 07:19.300
Do it.

07:22.380 --> 07:24.819
Crush the Imperial soldiers.

07:24.820 --> 07:27.489
As for Lady Sisbell—

07:27.490 --> 07:30.190
Lady Sisbell...?

07:33.410 --> 07:35.379
Where are they?!

07:35.380 --> 07:38.159
We're right behind you, old lady.

07:38.160 --> 07:40.939
We weren't hiding in the back room.

07:40.940 --> 07:42.889
We were in the one two doors before it.

07:42.890 --> 07:45.870
There's no one in this room
at the very back!

07:46.550 --> 07:49.410
But your footprints led
all the way to the back...

07:49.780 --> 07:51.979
It's backtracking.

07:51.980 --> 07:55.279
We left footprints all
the way to the back room,

07:55.280 --> 07:59.440
then stepped backward in our own tracks
to slip into the room before it.

08:00.130 --> 08:03.469
You damn filthy Imperials...!

08:03.470 --> 08:06.350
You've underestimated
the Imperial Army's captain.

08:08.810 --> 08:13.530
Are we safe now?

08:15.160 --> 08:17.269
This isn't the time to relax.

08:17.270 --> 08:18.950
We need to hurry downstairs!

08:20.560 --> 08:23.769
Well then, I'll be taking my leave first.

08:23.770 --> 08:25.229
What?!

08:25.230 --> 08:28.469
In a situation where the royal palace
is under attack by the Imperial Army,

08:28.470 --> 08:31.949
it would be unnatural for the head of
the family to remain absent for too long.

08:31.950 --> 08:35.599
You've all done well.
And you have my deepest respect.

08:35.600 --> 08:39.250
But we have fulfilled our purpose here.

08:39.730 --> 08:41.469
What does he mean by that?

08:41.470 --> 08:44.029
Don't tell me Sisbell has already been taken?

08:44.030 --> 08:46.010
No, is this another bluff?

08:46.400 --> 08:48.300
Not on my watch!

08:50.550 --> 08:51.679
What's this?

08:51.680 --> 08:53.089
Good instincts.

08:53.090 --> 08:58.439
You noticed 'this isn't my energy'
right away, didn't you?

08:58.440 --> 09:02.399
You're right.
This isn't my Star Spirit art.

09:02.400 --> 09:04.979
What is this phenomenon?

09:04.980 --> 09:06.810
I've seen something like this before...

09:07.900 --> 09:10.279
Just a short while ago...

09:10.280 --> 09:14.229
I had a conversation with the 'witch'
who escaped from the dungeon.

09:14.230 --> 09:15.249
A witch?

09:15.250 --> 09:17.120
You know her too.

09:17.620 --> 09:19.000
What?

09:19.660 --> 09:22.129
You may have defeated her once,

09:22.130 --> 09:25.699
but if you believed an Inquisition
isolation chamber could contain her,

09:25.700 --> 09:27.389
you're gravely mistaken.

09:27.390 --> 09:31.169
After all, she's no longer human...

09:31.170 --> 09:33.750
She's become a true witch.

09:34.260 --> 09:38.179
Gravity? A witch? Gravity...

09:38.180 --> 09:39.179
No, it can't be...?!

09:39.180 --> 09:43.080
Goodbye, romantic Saint Disciple.

09:44.520 --> 09:45.140
Wait!

09:45.980 --> 09:47.420
Vichyssoise.

09:48.510 --> 09:49.800
Ultimate Cannon:

09:50.640 --> 09:52.720
Magic Shot of Corpses.

10:03.950 --> 10:05.540
What...?

10:06.340 --> 10:08.749
What just happened?

10:08.750 --> 10:10.070
Hey, Boss.

10:10.630 --> 10:12.759
I said we should go downstairs,

10:12.760 --> 10:15.309
but I didn't say blow up the whole castle.

10:15.310 --> 10:16.899
It wasn't me!

10:16.900 --> 10:18.969
Yeah, I know that.

10:18.970 --> 10:21.020
This must be Hydra's doing.

10:21.680 --> 10:23.410
But where is that bastard?

10:34.290 --> 10:37.030
Sisbell, get!

10:37.410 --> 10:38.410
Sisbell!

10:40.030 --> 10:42.870
Ah, so you're still alive, Imperials.

10:43.230 --> 10:44.680
Lady Sisbell!

10:47.540 --> 10:49.000
Give her back!

10:49.430 --> 10:52.800
You fiend,
she is our country's greatest treasure!

10:53.460 --> 10:57.260
Too bad. Your master will not return.

10:57.840 --> 10:58.760
Forever.

10:59.280 --> 11:03.430
Silence! Let go of Lady Sisbell, you monster!

11:03.880 --> 11:05.640
You idiot, stop!

11:06.130 --> 11:09.060
Give Lady Sisbell back!

11:15.840 --> 11:18.299
It hurts!

11:18.300 --> 11:20.330
Just kidding.

11:25.450 --> 11:27.809
What a cute face.

11:27.810 --> 11:31.839
Figures you'd be chosen
to serve the Lou family.

11:31.840 --> 11:34.880
Shall I smash that pretty face of yours?

11:35.940 --> 11:37.409
N-No... Please, don't...

11:37.410 --> 11:40.710
Nope. I won't forgive you.

11:41.720 --> 11:43.110
Vichyssoise!

11:45.640 --> 11:47.979
Iska!

11:47.980 --> 11:50.189
You...! How did you—

11:50.190 --> 11:53.650
At the moment of the explosion,
I unleashed Talisman's wave.

11:54.740 --> 11:59.740
You're seven seconds too late, brave knight.

12:01.650 --> 12:03.780
Farewell, Saint Disciple.

12:06.260 --> 12:07.099
Lady Sisbell!

12:07.100 --> 12:09.459
Stop! It's too late!

12:09.460 --> 12:11.399
Let go of me, Imperial!

12:11.400 --> 12:15.710
What's the point of a servant
who can't protect Lady Sisbell?!

12:16.140 --> 12:17.970
We'll go rescue her.

12:18.910 --> 12:21.980
You all need to escape
the mansion and go hide.

12:22.590 --> 12:24.729
Why the hell should we trust you?!

12:24.730 --> 12:28.280
Lady Sisbell was just kidnapped
right in front of our eyes!

12:29.160 --> 12:31.610
You're the one who got
taken hostage, remember?

12:32.330 --> 12:37.159
Why do you think Iska called out her name
at that moment to draw attention?

12:37.160 --> 12:41.210
If he hadn't,
your face would've been smashed in.

12:44.670 --> 12:48.850
We'll get Sisbell back.
I swear it.

12:52.000 --> 12:55.089
And if we fail,
you can take my life.

12:55.090 --> 12:56.059
What?

12:56.060 --> 12:57.670
I can't explain everything now,

12:58.020 --> 13:02.930
but we came to the Sovereignty willing
to risk our lives to protect Sisbell.

13:03.520 --> 13:07.590
If you truly want to save her,
you must obey us just for this moment.

13:12.040 --> 13:14.229
We have to escape.
The castle is collapsing.

13:14.230 --> 13:15.110
Hurry!

13:16.400 --> 13:17.360
Yes!

13:17.740 --> 13:22.110
If you promise to follow our lead,
I'll let you go.

13:23.800 --> 13:26.920
We'll comply... just for tonight.

13:28.760 --> 13:32.920
If it means we can get Lady Sisbell back...

13:42.720 --> 13:45.370
Rin, what are you doing?

13:45.750 --> 13:47.930
It's been quite a while now...

13:49.040 --> 13:50.310
Lady Alice!

13:51.060 --> 13:53.500
Rin! I'm glad you're safe.

13:53.940 --> 13:55.629
Are the wounded all right?

13:55.630 --> 13:59.460
Yes! They are all being treated
at the Lou family shelter.

13:59.890 --> 14:02.150
Lady Alice!

14:02.690 --> 14:05.459
The Saint Disciple is in the Queen's Chamber!

14:05.460 --> 14:06.740
What?!

14:10.420 --> 14:11.540
Alice,

14:11.870 --> 14:17.440
you probably believe that as long as you're
here, you can save everything, don't you?

14:18.000 --> 14:21.759
You can drive back the Imperial Army
and protect the Queen.

14:21.760 --> 14:24.500
You believe in the strength
of your Star Spirit.

14:25.080 --> 14:28.099
You carry deep compassion for the people,

14:28.100 --> 14:30.339
and you have the strength

14:30.340 --> 14:37.210
to kill your emotions and fight 'ruthlessly'
in any battle to protect the Sovereignty.

14:37.940 --> 14:40.770
Those are truly admirable traits.

14:41.400 --> 14:42.620
But it's no good.

14:43.450 --> 14:46.830
Don't you think that path only
creates an Eden for the strong?

14:48.700 --> 14:53.400
Your ideals are based on your strength.

14:54.120 --> 14:57.140
But that strength can't save
every Star Spirit user.

14:58.370 --> 15:02.190
As the voice for those
who were never blessed by the stars,

15:03.010 --> 15:06.180
I will burn this false Eden to the ground.

15:07.850 --> 15:10.260
Burn it into your memory and despair.

15:11.060 --> 15:12.230
Alice...

15:12.770 --> 15:16.720
...watch as I am cut down
by the Imperial Army.

15:23.440 --> 15:24.110
What?

15:30.880 --> 15:34.820
Wait, Grandfather!
These Imperial soldiers are my—

15:35.700 --> 15:38.749
The little lady's thorns don't work on it,

15:38.750 --> 15:41.429
meaning it's pure Star Spirit energy,

15:41.430 --> 15:45.380
so physical interference can't touch it.

15:45.860 --> 15:48.300
What is that, Nameless?

15:49.300 --> 15:53.079
It's an Avatar created by that
so-called Star Spirit of Sin.

15:53.080 --> 15:55.270
Simply put, it's basically invincible.

15:55.590 --> 15:58.169
Oh, you lost your left arm, huh?

15:58.170 --> 15:59.980
I'll get him next time.

16:03.320 --> 16:08.400
So the doting grandpa stepped in
for his cute little granddaughter?

16:09.080 --> 16:11.490
How touching.

16:14.800 --> 16:17.640
I really hate you.

16:19.860 --> 16:22.690
Kissing, get back here right now.

16:23.160 --> 16:24.340
Uncle On?

16:25.140 --> 16:27.419
Something unexpected has happened.

16:27.420 --> 16:30.389
I'm withdrawing from battle and heading there.

16:30.390 --> 16:31.300
What happened?

16:31.690 --> 16:34.660
Elletear has headed to the Queen's Chamber.

16:35.670 --> 16:36.919
What?

16:36.920 --> 16:38.639
That's impossible.

16:38.640 --> 16:41.689
She's powerless and useless in combat.

16:41.690 --> 16:44.019
There's no way she'd go out into this chaos...

16:44.020 --> 16:45.949
That's right.

16:45.950 --> 16:49.610
I assumed she'd go to the shelter too, but...

16:52.610 --> 16:57.620
That was the technique that sliced an Imperial
bomber in half, "Great Scythe of the Air."

16:58.230 --> 17:00.390
Why are you still alive?

17:01.920 --> 17:04.840
I see. That's sure a useful Star Spirit.

17:05.400 --> 17:08.309
Fitting for a tyranny
descendant of the Founder

17:08.310 --> 17:10.449
and versatile enough to handle traps.

17:10.450 --> 17:12.140
It has a wide range of applications.

17:13.290 --> 17:15.970
What I ask is why are you unharmed?

17:17.120 --> 17:18.230
Because it's me.

17:18.770 --> 17:20.230
But I will cut you down next.

17:20.550 --> 17:23.309
I don't like that look you give me.

17:23.310 --> 17:26.240
It's the look I detest the most
in my experience.

17:26.670 --> 17:30.150
So disappear within
the graveyard of the winds.

17:30.550 --> 17:33.780
Destructive Winds:
Wind God Wind Realm Mandala.

17:35.870 --> 17:38.410
You misjudged me after all.

17:39.540 --> 17:43.129
Your wind avoids
Star Spirit energy as it moves.

17:43.130 --> 17:45.289
So it won't hit your own subordinates.

17:45.290 --> 17:46.839
That's your downfall.

17:46.840 --> 17:47.840
No way...!

17:48.440 --> 17:51.219
You were the traitor?!

17:51.220 --> 17:56.930
That's right. I betrayed you
to change this country.

17:57.350 --> 17:59.269
I knew you.

17:59.270 --> 18:03.689
But you saw me as nothing
more than an enemy soldier.

18:03.690 --> 18:04.650
That's the difference!

18:07.360 --> 18:10.110
This is where history changes.

18:25.520 --> 18:30.130
Mother... Run...

18:35.050 --> 18:37.140
Elletear...

18:42.920 --> 18:45.010
Sister Elletear...?

18:46.200 --> 18:47.670
Mother...?

18:51.500 --> 18:53.460
The Sovereignty has fallen.

18:54.850 --> 18:55.890
Impossible...

18:58.640 --> 18:59.970
A Saint Disciple?

19:00.750 --> 19:02.700
No, I don't care about that anymore.

19:03.430 --> 19:04.750
I was too naive.

19:05.530 --> 19:09.290
That's why I couldn't protect
Mother or Sister Elletear.

19:09.790 --> 19:13.840
In the end, Imperial dogs are things
that must be annihilated!

19:14.210 --> 19:15.930
Are you next?

19:16.610 --> 19:19.440
You filthy Imperials!

19:20.140 --> 19:21.849
That freezing aura...

19:21.850 --> 19:23.519
You're that Ice Calamity Witch.

19:23.520 --> 19:25.180
That's right.

19:25.840 --> 19:26.950
I'm a witch.

19:27.270 --> 19:31.099
I'll freeze every last one
of your Empire's cities,

19:31.100 --> 19:32.649
and you as well!

19:32.650 --> 19:34.610
Lady Alice! Stop it!

19:35.630 --> 19:38.189
You don't understand your situation here.

19:38.190 --> 19:39.969
I've already captured the Purebred.

19:39.970 --> 19:41.279
So I'm taking my leave now.

19:41.280 --> 19:42.990
Silence, you Imperial dog!

19:43.450 --> 19:48.080
Don't think for a second you'll
make it back in one piece!

19:48.650 --> 19:49.760
We'll see about that.

19:50.920 --> 19:52.070
Trying to run, are you?

19:52.620 --> 19:54.889
There's a hidden passageway in the back,

19:54.890 --> 19:58.669
but unless one of the Founder's descendants
touches it, it won't open...

19:58.670 --> 19:59.990
I have the key.

20:07.940 --> 20:11.770
You...! Just how far are you going
to treat my sister as a tool?!

20:12.250 --> 20:14.020
I'm just putting her to good use.

20:16.280 --> 20:17.650
Mother!

20:17.990 --> 20:20.380
Rin, how's Mother's condition?!

20:20.870 --> 20:23.660
The laceration on her left arm
has reached the bone...

20:24.670 --> 20:27.300
She needs immediate suturing surgery.

20:29.100 --> 20:31.750
Rin, I'm leaving everything to you.

20:32.230 --> 20:34.250
Proceed with your judgment.

20:36.260 --> 20:37.540
Lady Alice...

20:39.260 --> 20:40.930
I won't let you get away!

20:43.460 --> 20:45.890
I won't let you use my sister
for whatever you please!

20:50.230 --> 20:51.729
Lady Alice!

20:51.730 --> 20:53.029
Please, get in!

20:53.030 --> 20:54.270
Warvick!

20:54.660 --> 20:58.329
Lady Rin sent me.
She figured you'd need this for the chase.

20:58.330 --> 21:01.779
That's an excellent call.
Let's go, full speed ahead!

21:01.780 --> 21:02.780
Understood!

21:09.920 --> 21:13.670
Please, hurry! My sister's injury
is life-threatening!

21:14.320 --> 21:16.290
I'm well aware of that.

21:16.750 --> 21:17.420
However...

21:20.880 --> 21:22.729
Let me tell you now...

21:22.730 --> 21:26.379
Once we catch up to that car,
we head straight to the hospital.

21:26.380 --> 21:27.989
Of course.

21:27.990 --> 21:28.600
But...

21:29.110 --> 21:31.659
If my sister is beyond saving,

21:31.660 --> 21:33.870
we have to return to the castle immediately.

21:34.770 --> 21:37.240
To go to Her Majesty the Queen, I assume?

21:39.900 --> 21:40.850
No...

21:42.130 --> 21:44.640
I will crush the remaining Imperial soldiers.

21:47.680 --> 21:49.220
Understood.

22:00.800 --> 22:03.030
Lady Alice! I'm speeding up!

22:09.180 --> 22:10.179
Hurry!

22:10.180 --> 22:10.990
Yes!

22:14.580 --> 22:15.810
Don't tell me...!

22:20.820 --> 22:22.950
Even this was a trap...?

22:24.000 --> 22:27.190
He only pretended to be
carrying sister Elletear...

22:32.800 --> 22:34.830
Lady Alice...

22:35.940 --> 22:38.700
Please... rest assured...

22:39.050 --> 22:41.060
Lady Alice...

22:44.880 --> 22:46.060
You...

22:46.470 --> 22:48.290
I'm glad you're sa—

22:56.090 --> 22:58.880
You protected me?

23:01.690 --> 23:04.200
I'll call for help right away!

23:04.620 --> 23:08.830
Rin, please! Bring the medical
team here, immediately!

23:09.200 --> 23:10.439
Lady Alice?!

23:10.440 --> 23:12.080
Yes, I'll arrange it at once!

23:12.500 --> 23:13.780
I'm counting on you.

23:26.100 --> 23:26.890
Why?!

23:28.100 --> 23:30.410
I was supposed to save them!

23:32.310 --> 23:35.310
Mother, sister Elletear,

23:36.220 --> 23:37.730
even Warvick...

23:39.190 --> 23:40.230
But why...

23:43.660 --> 23:44.740
Why...

23:47.010 --> 23:50.210
Why won't anything go right?!

23:51.950 --> 23:58.360
I rushed to the Queen's Chamber to put out
the flames in the palace to protect Mother...

23:59.130 --> 24:04.420
I rushed all the way here to get
sister Elletear back...!

24:07.820 --> 24:10.620
And yet, everything's falling apart...

24:17.680 --> 24:19.600
At this most important moment,

24:20.150 --> 24:25.380
why can't I save even a single person?!

24:27.110 --> 24:28.350
Imperial Army...

24:28.780 --> 24:32.120
No, the Imperial people, all of you!

24:33.240 --> 24:37.010
If this is what you truly want,

24:37.420 --> 24:39.930
then I will never forgive you!

24:41.400 --> 24:43.179
Prepare yourself!

24:43.180 --> 24:47.470
I swear I'll have my revenge!

24:48.240 --> 24:49.090
Alice!

24:53.830 --> 24:54.760
Alice...

24:57.000 --> 24:58.520
Iska...
